# "Sacrifice a creature or enchantment or pay {2}" (CR 601.2b, 118.8): Bot1 sacrifices its Ornithopter (a creature) and pays only {1}{R}
# (Mox Ruby and Mox Jet) for "5 damage to target creature" aimed at Bot2's Ornithopter, which would die and is exiled instead (CR 614.1a).
# Bot1's own Ornithopter went to the graveyard as the cost; Bot2's goes to exile, not the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Betrayer's Bargain
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Betrayer's Bargain.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Modes(Sacrifice a creature or enchantment)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Betrayer's Bargain; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
